Dialogue: 6,0:00:04.05,0:00:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perasan tak,\Nada teh yang bulat?
Dialogue: 6,0:00:10.83,0:00:12.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Assalamualaikum.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:12.83,0:00:14.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Awak tahu saya dekat mana?
Dialogue: 6,0:00:14.20,0:00:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Saya dekat Tepak Marketing.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:17.20,0:00:21.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rupa-rupanya semua\Nproduk Lipton
Dialogue: 6,0:00:21.05,0:00:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,dibungkus di sini.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:23.45,0:00:27.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siapa peminat teh,\Npeminat Lipton terutamanya…
Dialogue: 6,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kita berada di kilang
Dialogue: 6,0:00:30.10,0:00:32.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,yang membungkus\Nteh kegemaran anda.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:32.65,0:00:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jom!
Dialogue: 6,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kita mula dekat sini.
Dialogue: 6,0:00:51.35,0:00:54.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kita punya proses,\Nbahan mentah
Dialogue: 6,0:00:54.50,0:00:57.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,kita masuk daripada sebelah,
Dialogue: 6,0:00:57.10,0:01:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,dia akan bawa ke sini\Nuntuk proses blending.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:02.43,0:01:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kita ada uncang-uncang\Nbulat tu,
Dialogue: 6,0:01:04.43,0:01:08.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,output mesin tu\Nterlampau laju,
Dialogue: 6,0:01:08.13,0:01:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,satu minit boleh buat\N1,000 hingga 1,200 uncang.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:12.08,0:01:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kita dapat pastikan setiap pek\Ntimbangannya betul.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:16.73,0:01:19.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kita ikut Akta Makanan,
Dialogue: 6,0:01:20.03,0:01:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,tak boleh kurang daripada\Nyang dibenarkan.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:24.18,0:01:25.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Berapa, dik, dia punya berat?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:27.03,0:01:29.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,252 sampai 253, selalu.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:29.48,0:01:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Setiap sejam, kita akan ada\Nquality control,
Dialogue: 6,0:01:32.03,0:01:33.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,cek dari printing.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:36.63,0:01:37.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kita akan compare dengan
Dialogue: 6,0:01:37.93,0:01:39.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master Blend\Natau Master Sample.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:39.76,0:01:41.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dengan production sekarang,
Dialogue: 6,0:01:41.18,0:01:44.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,match tak dengan\NMaster Sample.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:44.73,0:01:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hari-hari kena rasa.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:46.93,0:01:48.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lipton yang dah dibungkus,
Dialogue: 6,0:01:48.33,0:01:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,40 uncang sepaket,
Dialogue: 6,0:01:51.83,0:01:55.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,siap dengan tarikh\Nakhir penggunaan.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:55.98,0:01:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Logo halal pun ada.
Dialogue: 6,0:01:59.53,0:02:01.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lipton memang nama\Nyang terkenal.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:03.17,0:02:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dia target hanya\N10 tan setahun.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:06.73,0:02:08.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tapi Alhamdulillah, tahun\Npertama kita launch,
Dialogue: 6,0:02:08.93,0:02:10.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,dapat 30 tan.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:10.53,0:02:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maksudnya, 3 kali ganda.
Dialogue: 6,0:02:13.23,0:02:16.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alhamdulillah, kita dah\Nmencapai 1,400 tan setahun.
